  m_Text: "From time to time, your city may face social or health crises. Here\u2019s
    how your residents react:\n\nHealth Emergencies\n\nTriggered randomly or when
    health rate is low.\nA resident turns blue and collapses.\nA nearby Doctor will
    try to reach and cure them.\n\nIf cured in time \u2192 Resident returns to normal.\n"
