    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Welcome to City Planner Simulator! This book is your essential companion
    for understanding the mechanics, strategies, and tips to build and manage your
    dream city. Whether you are a beginner or an experienced planner, this guide
    will help you make the most out of your city-building experience.\nInside, you
    will find:\n\n-A breakdown of core gameplay mechanics\n\n-Tips and strategies
    for efficient city planning\n\n-Insights into managing resources, traffic, and
    citizen happiness\n\n-Advanced techniques for optimizing city growth\n\nAs you
    progress, refer to this book whenever you need guidance or inspiration. Now,
    let\u2019s get started on building the perfect city!"
