    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "WHAT ARE ZONE BONUSES?\n\n\tIn City Planner Simulator, placing buildings
    of the same type close together can form districts. When a district is formed,
    it activates a Zone Effect \u2014 a gameplay bonus that benefits your city in
    various ways.\n\nEach zone effect is unique and provides strategic value, encouraging
    smart placement of structures.\n\nHOW TO FORM A ZONE?\n\n\tPlace multiple buildings
    of the same type near each other.\n\nOnce the required conditions are met, a
    district is formed automatically.\n\nThe effect remains active as long as the
    district structure is maintained."
