  m_Text: 'The Store is the player''s gateway to purchasing and placing buildings
    on the map. It''s a central gameplay hub that defines the development and direction
    of the city.


    Purpose

    Offers a catalog of available buildings


    Shows
    cost, effects, and requirements for each structure


    Allows player to select,
    preview, and place buildings on valid tiles.


'
