  m_Text: "In City Planner Simulator, buildings and structures are the foundation
    of your city\u2019s success. Each type of building serves a unique purpose and
    contributes to different aspects of urban life\u2014economy, safety, happiness,
    and growth. Understanding their functions and interactions is key to creating
    a thriving city. "
