    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Obstacles are physical impediments on buildable tiles. Players must pay
    a removal cost to clear them before placing structures.


    There are three
    types of obstacles in the game and they are different only by cost you need to
    spend to remove them.


    Small obstacle - 100 coins.

    Medium obstacle
    - 250 coins.

    Large obstacle - 500 coins.


    You cannot place any structure
    on the tile where the obstacle is located so take care of removing them first.'
