    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "From time to time, your city may face social or health crises. Here\u2019s
    how your residents react:\n\nRobbery Events\n\nTriggered when crime rate is high.\n\nA
    resident turns red and runs toward a market to rob it.\nA nearby Policeman will
    chase and try to stop them.\n\nIf stopped \u2192 Resident returns to normal.\n"
