  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 4beb055f07aaff244873dec698d0363e, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 14
    m_FontStyle: 3
    m_BestFit: 1
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Your city's population is more than just numbers \u2014 they are active
    participants in your economy and society. Residents:\n\nPay taxes (fueling your
    income)\n\nConsume goods (driving commercial demand)\n\nWork in buildings (influencing
    productivity)\n\nDefine rates (health, happiness, crime, employment)ultiplier
    (e.g. +2\xD7 multiplier to morale systems).\n\nSome residents become specialized
    agents when placed near the right buildings:\n\nPoliceman:\n-Placed when you
    build a Police Station\t\n-Fights crime and prevents robberies\n\nDoctor\t\n-Placed
    when you build a Hospital\t\n-Cures sick residents to prevent deaths\n"
