    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "City rates are key indicators that define the overall condition, events,
    and income of your metropolis. Keeping these rates within healthy ranges not
    only boosts your economy but also helps prevent negative events such as robberies
    or health crises.\n\nHealthcare Rate\n\nIt measures availability and quality
    of medical services. Low healthcare increases death events; high healthcare keeps
    citizens healthy and alive.\n\nHow calulated:\n\nBase Health: 30\n\nIncreases
    by 0.3 \xD7 Education Rate and by (Number of Hospitals \xD7 10)\n\nSmoothed with
    \u03B1 = 0.1, clamped 0\u2013100"
